MarketAddCollateralTest
├── given onBehalf is this adapter address
│   └── it should revert
├── given assets is max uint256
│   ├── when adapter has zero collateral token balance
│   │   └── it should revert
│   └── when adapter has collateral token balance
│       └── it should add collateral with adapter balance
└── given assets is not max uint256
    ├── when assets is zero
    │   └── it should revert
    └── when assets is greater than zero
        └── it should add collateral with specified assets 